---
/**
 * Note
 * A smaller aside under a block, set in the muted ink. It is where a page says
 * what it is not showing: proprietary work, a password protected file, a claim
 * that needs a caveat.
 *
 * It is not a warning and carries no role, so a screen reader reads it in the
 * flow of the page like any other paragraph.
 */
---

<p class="sdc-cs-note"><slot /></p>
